{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在炎炎夏日，想要品嚐消暑甜品解渴降溫，不妨跟著肥媽製作這款生津止渴的「台式雜錦凍」。這款夏日甜點不僅色彩繽紛，更擁有獨特的豐富口感，其果凍吃起來集爽口、黏性與嚼勁於一身，質感宛如蒟蒻。再搭配咬下會瞬間爆發果汁的爆珠丸，以及充滿彈性的地瓜小丸子，絕對能為味蕾帶來充滿驚喜的夏日享受。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7222a0e1-8fa7-4da7-98b9-975f3b6dec4c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ACvnODBDxu1787219415.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7222a0e1-8fa7-4da7-98b9-975f3b6dec4c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><strong>材料</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">冬瓜糖 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">地瓜小丸子 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">爆珠丸（芒果味、藍莓味、荔枝味） </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">果凍粉 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">水果 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">檸檬汁</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><strong>做法</strong></span></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e6535942-397f-474a-824c-e15c79abed5a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20269yrd4IJ3eN1787219415.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e6535942-397f-474a-824c-e15c79abed5a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"72170f99-6a00-489e-8703-cce7388e2c68.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026TPVetWzz311787219415.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"72170f99-6a00-489e-8703-cce7388e2c68.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\"><strong>台式甜品食譜｜台式雜錦凍小貼士</strong></span></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T02:18:52.392403+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}